WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.992
Meet Tempo by ValueBridge: tasks, scheduling, focus and reviews in one private app

2
00:00:05.992 --> 00:00:07.800
that opens in your browser.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.840
The Today page shows how full your day is before it overfills, with your timeline

4
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.330
and your three priorities.

5
00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:22.705
Type a task the way you'd say it. Tempo picks out the date, time, length, priority

6
00:00:22.705 --> 00:00:24.423
and project as you type.

7
00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:30.970
Press Auto-plan, and Tempo fits your tasks into free time around your meetings, by

8
00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:35.918
deadline, priority and energy, with buffers and your lunch kept clear. Drag any

9
00:00:35.918 --> 00:00:36.983
block to move it.

10
00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:43.755
While Tempo is open, alerts appear with a chime and snooze. Export to your calendar

11
00:00:43.755 --> 00:00:46.027
app for reminders when it's closed.

12
00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:51.674
Run timed focus sessions on a task, and Tempo logs the time for you.

13
00:00:54.001 --> 00:00:58.797
Habits and insights show your streaks, your meeting load, and how close your

14
00:00:58.797 --> 00:00:59.681
estimates are.

15
00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:04.754
It opens on your phone too. Add it to your home screen.

16
00:01:06.167 --> 00:01:11.340
One licence, no subscription, and your data stays on your device. Tempo, by

17
00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:12.167
ValueBridge.

